      "id": "C1",
      "reason": "Class70..86 only binds an lvalue std::array reference; explicit noexcept constructor/destructor, deleted copy and move, no heap owner/callback/release state/secret copy. secure_wipe55..68 itself is not declared noexcept, so declaration traits alone are insufficient; actual array instantiation performs data/size/byte arithmetic, volatile stores and atomic signal fence with no ordinary throwing operation on a live array."
