      "reason": "Tests instantiate production guard, observe arrays while lifetime persists, populate relevant arrays before exit and preserve unrelated0x91 buffer. Normal and early return populate PRF only; first-cut leaves wrapping/PRK zero; nested fills all three. Traits are uncompiled declarations. Four strict-token CTest branches return before baseline filesystem/provider fixtures; no production allocator/device proof."
